<noinclude>{{Documentationpage}}</noinclude>
Template for easy linking of templates with the appearance of wiki syntax.

==Usage==
<pre>{{tl|name}}</pre>

===Parameters===
{{Docparam|name=&lt;unnamed 1>|req=yes|default=|desc=
Name of the template (without "Template:").
}}

==Example==
<pre>{{tl|Main}}</pre>
results in:
{{tl|Main}}

